## Data Enrichment Potential

| Category | Enrichment Opportunity |
|----------|------------------------|
| **Halden's current DOT approval status by state** | Determine which of the 29 active states Halden is already on APL/QPL. Internal audit of compliance files; CEO/Sales team interview. |
| **Revenue split: DOT-specified vs. open-market sales** | Understand what percentage of $27.9M revenue is driven by specification-required purchases. Customer order analysis; sales team classification. |
| **Current NASPEC audit status and testing certifications** | Confirm whether Halden has current NASPEC DataMine results. Internal compliance files; NASPEC DataMine search. |
| **Manufacturing capacity utilization rate** | Assess how much incremental volume the 23 lines can absorb without CapEx. Operations team assessment. |
| **State-specific seal profile demand estimates** | Estimate seal profile procurement volume per state from NRIP projects. State rail electrification office plans; contractor survey. |
| **Competitor DOT approval status** | Identify which competitors are on the APL/QPL in each target state. Pull each state's APL/QPL PDF and catalog competitor presence (Region 3 DOT QPL-5 is a template [19]). |

